" space) into one."
msgstr "将连续相同的分隔符（``.``、``-``、``_``、空格）合并为一个。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid "Presets"
msgstr "保存项"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"The search and replace combos keep a history of the patterns used (most "
"recent first); the button next to each combo adds the current pattern to "
"it. **Edit → History…** edits the search, replacement and :ref:`sidecar "
"filter <sidecar-filter>` histories: add, remove, reorder, sort, or clear."
msgstr ""
"搜索和替换下拉框会保留所用模式的历史记录（最近的在前）；每个下拉框旁的按钮会把当前模式加入其中。**编辑 → 历史记录…** 可编辑搜索、替换和 "
":ref:`Sidecar 过滤器 <sidecar-filter>` 的历史记录：添加、删除、调整顺序、排序或清空。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"The **Save** field gives the current settings a name: type a name and "
"click **Save**, pick it later from the same drop-down to restore it, or "
"click **Delete** to remove it.  Named saves can also be loaded with "
"``--saved`` in headless mode.  Histories and named saves belong to the "
"current :ref:`profile <profiles>`."
msgstr ""
"**保存** 字段为当前设置命名：输入名称并点击 **保存**，之后在同一下拉框中选择它即可恢复，或点击 **删除** "
"将其删除。命名保存项也可以在无界面模式下用 ``--saved`` 加载。历史记录和命名保存项属于当前 :ref:`配置文件 "
"<profiles>`。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid "Applying renames"
msgstr "应用重命名"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"Click **Rename** (**F2**) to apply the renames shown in the Preview "
"column. The button shows how many files will be renamed, e.g. **Rename "
"(12)**, and is only enabled when a preview is displayed and has no "
"conflict.  The status bar reports how many files were renamed."
msgstr ""
"点击 **重命名**\\ （**F2**）应用“预览”列中显示的重命名。按钮会显示将要重命名的文件数，例如 **重命名 "
"(12)**，并且只有在显示了无冲突的预览时才可用。状态栏会报告已重命名的文件数。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Renaming is atomic: every target is checked first, and if one of them "
"fails during the operation, the renames already done are rolled back.  "
"When the new name contains a folder (a :ref:`schema <schema-mode>` or a "
"``{dest}`` template), missing folders are created, and source folders "
"left empty below the listed folder are removed.  After a rename the "
"Preview column is cleared."
msgstr ""
"重命名是原子操作：先检查所有目标，若其中之一在操作过程中失败，已完成的重命名会被回滚。当新名称包含文件夹时（:ref:`模式结构 <schema-"
"mode>` 或带 ``{dest}`` 的模板），会创建缺少的文件夹，并删除所列文件夹下变为空的源文件夹。重命名后，“预览”列会被清空。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"Click **Undo** to revert the most recent batch.  Each rename batch is "
"recorded on an undo stack; the button label shows the number of available"
" batches (e.g. **Undo (3)**) when more than one is queued.  Moves made by"
" drag and drop, :ref:`rotations and EXIF orientation resets <image-"
"rotation>` are recorded on the same stack."
msgstr ""
"点击 **撤销** 可撤回最近一批操作。每批重命名都会记录到撤销栈中；当有多批可撤销时，按钮标签会显示数量（例如 **撤销 "
"(3)**）。拖放产生的移动、:ref:`旋转和 EXIF 方向重置 <image-rotation>` 也记录在同一个栈中。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "快捷方式"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"The **Shortcuts** menu provides one-click navigation to common "
"directories."
msgstr "**快捷方式** 菜单提供一键跳转到常用目录。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid "**System directories**"
msgstr "**系统目录**"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"The top of the menu lists platform directories (Home, Desktop, Documents,"
