# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"JPEG files are rotated with ``jpegtran`` (from libjpeg-turbo), which "
"turns them without recompressing; other formats are saved by Pillow, "
"without loss where the format allows it.  Rotations and EXIF resets can "
"be undone with **Undo**."
msgstr ""
"JPEG 文件用 ``jpegtran``\\ （来自 libjpeg-turbo）旋转，不会重新压缩；其他格式由 Pillow "
"保存，在格式允许时无损。旋转和 EXIF 方向重置可以用 **撤销** 撤回。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid "The image viewer"
msgstr "图片查看器"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"**Images → View** opens the image viewer on the selected images and "
"videos (a video is shown as a placeholder).  The viewer follows the "
"selection of the file list.  It offers:"
msgstr "**图像 → 查看** 用所选的图像和视频打开图片查看器（视频以占位图显示）。查看器会跟随文件列表的选择。它提供："

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"zoom modes in the toolbar: fit window (**0** or **X**), actual size "
"(**1** or **Z**), fit width (**W**), fit height (**H**), and zoom in and "
"out (**+** and **−**); drag to pan, double-click to centre on a point, "
"**Ctrl+click** and **Ctrl+right-click** to zoom on a point;"
msgstr ""
"工具栏中的缩放模式：适应窗口（**0** 或 **X**）、实际大小（**1** 或 "
