msgstr "*扩展名标准化* 选项卡：*标准化扩展名* 模式使用的表（见 :ref:`extension-mode`）。"

# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
msgid ""
"The settings of a profile are in **Profile → Profile configuration…** "
